### Memory Module API Tests
### Use these with VS Code REST Client extension

@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000
@userId = MbG3wwDSH1o5lqQYoFG1

# =============================================================================
# SRS - Smart Retrieval System
# =============================================================================

### List all vector stores
GET {{baseUrl}}/memory/stores

###

### Get loaded stores (in memory)
GET {{baseUrl}}/memory/stores/loaded

###

### Explain query routing
GET {{baseUrl}}/memory/route?query=iron deficiency during pregnancy

###

### Query knowledge base
POST {{baseUrl}}/memory/query?user_id={{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "What foods are high in iron during pregnancy?",
  "top_k_stores": 2,
  "top_k_chunks": 5,
  "include_context": true
}

###

### Query about heart health
POST {{baseUrl}}/memory/query?user_id={{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "What are symptoms of heart palpitations?",
  "top_k_stores": 2,
  "top_k_chunks": 5,
  "include_context": false
}

###

### Query about vitamins
POST {{baseUrl}}/memory/query?user_id={{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "Vitamin D requirements during pregnancy",
  "top_k_stores": 3,
  "top_k_chunks": 8
}


# =============================================================================
# Symptom Tracking - Medic Stones
# =============================================================================

### Log a symptom
POST {{baseUrl}}/memory/symptoms?user_id={{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "symptom_name": "headache",
  "severity": 3,
  "description": "Mild headache in the afternoon",
  "notes": "After skipping lunch"
}

###

### Log another symptom
POST {{baseUrl}}/memory/symptoms?user_id={{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "symptom_name": "fatigue",
  "severity": 4,
  "description": "Extreme tiredness despite sleeping 8 hours"
}

###

### Log nausea
POST {{baseUrl}}/memory/symptoms?user_id={{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "symptom_name": "nausea",
  "severity": 2,
  "description": "Morning sickness"
}

###

### Get recent symptoms (7 days)
GET {{baseUrl}}/memory/symptoms/{{userId}}?days=7

###

### Get symptoms for 30 days
GET {{baseUrl}}/memory/symptoms/{{userId}}?days=30

###

### Get symptom timeline
GET {{baseUrl}}/memory/symptoms/{{userId}}/timeline?days=30

###

### Get symptom patterns
GET {{baseUrl}}/memory/symptoms/{{userId}}/patterns?days=60

###

### Get symptom frequencies
GET {{baseUrl}}/memory/symptoms/{{userId}}/frequencies?days=30

###

### Delete a symptom (replace STONE_ID with actual ID)
# DELETE {{baseUrl}}/memory/symptoms/{{userId}}/STONE_ID


# =============================================================================
# Doctor Summary
# =============================================================================

### Generate doctor summary (JSON)
GET {{baseUrl}}/memory/doctor-summary/{{userId}}?days=30&format=json

###

### Generate doctor summary (Markdown)
GET {{baseUrl}}/memory/doctor-summary/{{userId}}?days=30&format=markdown


# =============================================================================
# Context Pyramid
# =============================================================================

### Get full context pyramid
POST {{baseUrl}}/memory/context/{{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "What should I eat for iron deficiency?",
  "max_tokens": 2000
}

###

### Get context pyramid for symptoms query
POST {{baseUrl}}/memory/context/{{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "I'm feeling tired and having headaches",
  "max_tokens": 1500,
  "layers": [0, 2, 3]
}

###

### Get context string (LLM-ready)
GET {{baseUrl}}/memory/context/{{userId}}/string?query=nutrition advice&max_tokens=2000

###

### Get Layer 0 - User Info
GET {{baseUrl}}/memory/context/{{userId}}/layer/0

###

### Get Layer 1 - Nutrient Trends
GET {{baseUrl}}/memory/context/{{userId}}/layer/1

###

### Get Layer 2 - Recent Symptoms
GET {{baseUrl}}/memory/context/{{userId}}/layer/2

###

### Get Layer 3 - Allergies
GET {{baseUrl}}/memory/context/{{userId}}/layer/3

###

### Get Layer 4 - Message History
GET {{baseUrl}}/memory/context/{{userId}}/layer/4
